WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.890
This is where the name Sound Shaper comes from: Shape.

2
00:00:02.890 --> 00:00:07.000
You're a sound shaper — well, not you, the app.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.216
There are ready-made presets,

4
00:00:09.216 --> 00:00:13.190
and a manual equalizer if you know more about music.

5
00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:16.182
You can change the song's speed: slow, fast,

6
00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:17.338
however you like.
